  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1002.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1002.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement RSA 486-A by establishing procedures and standards for the application and award of grants to purchase land or conservation easements for land within the source water protection areas of active, proposed, or future sources of public water supply for community or non-community, non-transient water systems, to ensure the permanent protection of these critical drinking water resources.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 1002) #9490, eff 6-23-09; ss by #9932, eff 5-27-11; ss by #12441, eff 1-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1000.html"
}
